# ===================================================================
# ASP.NET Core Web API & Razor Pages Specific
# ===================================================================
## User secrets file (contains sensitive data, should never be committed)
**/secrets.json
secrets.json

## IIS Express settings
**/applicationhost.config

## Publishing profiles
**/Properties/PublishProfiles/
**/Properties/launchSettings.json

## Client-side library manager
/libman.json
/lib/

## Entity Framework Core migration files (optional, but often ignored in team environments
## where migrations are managed via a central database or script)
# Migrations/

